  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/433/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"752\" height=\"221\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>新增 Alex's Mobs 與 Farmer's Delight 之間的相容性</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"color:#f00\">這些模組為必要安裝條件&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1.18 及以下版本已停止支援</span></em></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10px\">也歡迎查看&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-abnormalities\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Abnormalities</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/389/screenshot-2022-08-20-120945.png\" width=\"563\" height=\"212\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>目前包含的料理：</strong></span></p>\n<p>袋鼠腿排</p>\n<p>鬆軟麋排骨</p>\n<p>野牛肉</p>\n<p>野牛漢堡肉</p>\n<p>菇肉</p>\n<p>菇肉炸腿</p>\n<p>鯰魚片</p>\n<p>袋鼠燉菜</p>\n<p>麋排骨串燒食譜</p>\n<p>蛆蟲沙拉</p>\n<p>龍蝦義大利麵</p>\n<p>金合歡花湯</p>\n<p>菌絲麵包</p>\n<p>野牛漢堡</p>\n<p>菇肉三明治</p>\n<p>袋鼠義大利麵</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><em>如果新的袋鼠漢堡食譜或野牛／菇肉戰利品表無法正常運作，請先停用並重新啟用 Alex's Delight 資料包，接著再啟用 Alex&rsquo;s Mobs 資料包。</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#00f\">感謝超過 20,000,000 次下載！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f0f\">如果您有任何問題、建議，或希望加入本模組，歡迎加入&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#f0f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/J33aMKf4SC\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器！</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\">歡迎隨時推薦新功能</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">您可在任何整合包或影片中自由使用本模組。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">透過<span style=\"color:#00f\"> <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d107\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a>&nbsp;</span>可享首月 85 折優惠！請務必在結帳時輸入優惠碼。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1337193880688394401/1355010693073604808/Baisylia_New.png?ex=67e75f8c&is=67e60e0c&hm=cd082c86d0f99230eafdce1907fa29eaf469d34512764d11f9d874a6ebd7937d&=&format=webp&quality=lossless\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></span></p>",
